$stats=['clients'=>(int)db()->query("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM clients")->fetchColumn(),'orders'=>(int)db()->query("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM commandes WHERE statut<>'retire'")->fetchColumn(),'ready'=>(int)db()->query("SELECT COUNT(*) FROM commandes WHERE statut='pret'")->fetchColumn(),'revenue'=>(float)db()->query("SELECT COALESCE(SUM(montant),0) FROM paiements WHERE EXTRACT(MONTH FROM date_paiement)=EXTRACT(MONTH FROM CURRENT_DATE) AND EXTRACT(YEAR FROM date_paiement)=EXTRACT(YEAR FROM CURRENT_DATE)")->fetchColumn(),'margin'=>(float)db()->query("SELECT COALESCE(SUM(oi.sous_total - oi.quantite*oi.cout_unitaire),0) FROM commande_lignes oi JOIN commandes o ON o.id=oi.commande_id WHERE EXTRACT(MONTH FROM o.date_depot)=EXTRACT(MONTH FROM CURRENT_DATE) AND EXTRACT(YEAR FROM o.date_depot)=EXTRACT(YEAR FROM CURRENT_DATE)")->fetchColumn()];
$recent=db()->query("SELECT o.*,o.reference AS code,o.date_promise AS date_prevue,o.depose_par AS user_id,c.nom,c.prenom FROM commandes o JOIN clients c ON c.id=o.client_id ORDER BY o.id DESC LIMIT 8")->fetchAll();require 'includes/header.php';?>
